SY_TALK("P7H9MSLjL80",[[17,["and because of the cleansing","of the feet of Christ"]],[22,["they said, \"Why should we waste such a lot of","oil? You can sell it and give it to the poor.\""]],[27,["but Christ said, now see what he said!"]],[29,["that Christ Himself has said these words","and if they are depicted the same way."]],[36,["You just see the meaning and","what you should take out."]],[38,["He says that, \"These poor are for","ever, but I am for a short time."]],[44,["You see? How clearly He has said that","there's no philanthropic work involved."]],[52,["But people take the other meaning! I don't","know from where you get the other meaning?"]],[56,["That you must look after the poor."]],[59,["That's not you job at all!"]],[62,["Alright Atul? That's not your","job to look after the poor."]],[68,["What we have to work out,","in the middle, you see."]],[72,["by which we can pull the right","and left to both the banks."]],[77,["You have to be in the middle. When","we are in the middle course,"]],[81,["we first of all settle down ourselves nicely","and then the left and right can be engulfed."]],[87,["The poor and the rich! The","over-rich are horrid people!"]],[94,["They smoke and they drink. I","mean, they are wretched people."]],[98,["Gambling, this, that, all","sorts of things they do."]],[101,["They waste their lives. They don't","know how to face themselves."]],[103,["They are in the worst possible condition."]],[106,["And the poor are another style,","labour class and all that."]],[114,["So you have to bring them","to the centre. But how?"]],[116,["You, yourself have the depth within yourself."]],[121,["You can pull of them together into this."]],[124,["First solution has to","come in the central path."]],[129,["Alright?"]],[129,["So this is it, that, when you start doing your","philanthropic work, you cannot do it with Sahaja Yoga,"]],[134,["you cannot."]],[136,["Of course, I mean poor is alright, in","the Indian villages, I can work it out."]],[141,["But very poor, they will not take to Sahaja Yoga."]],[147,["They'll take to drinking, smoking or if some","time is left, then burgling or cheating."]],[156,["They will take to these things, because","for them, eating is the main thing."]],[161,["Just like animals they are."]],[164,["And for the very rich, they","are another type of animal."]],[169,["They are vultures."]],[171,["They cannot live without being parasites."]],[176,["If you tell then anything,","they will not understand you."]],[179,["So, the upper class is useless and","the lower class is useless for us."]],[182,["Ours is the middle class, which has to","settle down with the values of Sahaja Yoga."]],[192,["And then once they see","you, the river flowing,"]],[196,["they can be enriched and","they will come to us."]],[203,["You are like a river and we have to enrich","both the banks, this side or that side."]],[213,["That is important."]],[215,["One side you have to cleanse the upper class","and the lower class you have to enrich them."]],[222,["But if you do not have that within","yourselves, how are you going to do it?"]],[227,["Sahaja Yoga is going to work for the","middle class. This is the point."]],[237,["Not for the poor and the greedy."]],[239,["And that's a very wrong thing to","do, attention is put to the poor"]],[242,["That's not our job. We have","not created the poor. Have we?"]],[246,["We have not."]],[247,["Who has created them?"]],[250,["The upper class!"]],[252,["We club them together, the","upper and lower class."]],[256,["So they say, \"We will have","Labour government.\""]],[260,["Both are just the same!"]],[270,["That's it you see. They say by","denying God, we are challenging God."]],[275,["If they deny God, then God will fall at","their feet. That is why they deny God."]],[280,["Otherwise, what is the need?"]],[282,["What matters? Is he","standing for any election?"]],[285,["Is he contesting any election that you are saying,\"We","do not believe in God?\" What does it matter?"]],[295,["So that is what we understand","that these are fools."]],[301,["Is there any way, Mother that...?"]],[303,["That's what I said that, the way is that the middle","class, you see, the middle class should be developed."]],[310,["all these people who are on the extremes like","they say, I do not believe and I am angry.\""]],[317,["Then let it be. You don't make them believe."]],[320,["Yes, but is there any way of helping them to","come to an understanding in the beginning?"]],[325,["You see, if you think that you can make these","people believe, you cannot. It's wrong."]],[332,["They will not. They will not, because the more you will try to","do it, the more they'll continue, you see their ego is hurt."]],[338,["They are the people whose ego is hurt,","because they find some people rich. You see."]],[343,["Say, the person on this bank and on","this bank: he sees this, he sees this."]],[347,["We are somewhere down below here, alright?"]],[350,["And they are seeing each other.","So their ego is hurt very much."]],[355,["And here there are people","who are egotistical."]],[357,["So both do not believe in God. What","does it matter if the believe it or not?"]],[362,["There is God."]],[367,["You see they just want to say it out. Here","is, a big words! I have seen everybody."]],[371,["\"I believe...\" Now, who are you?"]],[374,["Everyone says, \"I believe into...\" I","mean believing from where it has come?"]],[381,["From where did you get this","belief? What is your experience?"]],[385,["So that's how they do it."]],[388,["So they have to say, if a politician comes up and","gives a lecture. \"I believe that this is this.\""]],[394,["So everybody hears that, so they go on","home. They say, \"I believe in this!\""]],[399,["This is like ringing one bell, putting into another bell","and the resonance starts and everyone says, \"I believe.\""]],[406,["You see, I find in this country, even","an ordinary beggar talks like that!"]],[416,["There's no humility of any kind."]],[418,["That's why they talk like","that. They lack all humility."]],[424,["They are so aggressive. You just","see how aggressive they are."]],[427,["They have aggressed all the cultures of the world."]],[429,["Now today's article, I brought","it for you to see especially."]],[432,["You see now, in say, Tehran,"]],[435,["whatever they have done,","Tehranis have done,"]],[437,["they have put a chaddar on a lady","and say,\"You wear a chaddar.\""]],[442,["So an English lady writes about it. She","says, \"They have made our body....\""]],[449,["You see now, your attitude towards life, you can say","a British attitude or you can say a Western attitude"]],[453,["is that your body is very","beautiful, so you must show it."]],[457,["Why? Why cheat yourself?"]],[459,["It is not because your body is beautiful that","you are showing it off, but you want to catch it."]],[464,["It's simple."]],[467,["It is as simple as that.Face it!"]],[470,["But you want all the world, all over","the world, the women should be like you."]],[479,["It's such a subtle","aggression. You don't know."]],[481,["They have killed all the cultures of the world with","this kind of an understanding that, \"We are the best!\""]],[488,["Most educated and sophisticated people."]],[497,["But others also must exist. They have their","own cultures, understand them and think."]],[501,["If you do not say, \"Please, give","me this,\" then he is uncultured."]],[512,["You know, it is such a subtle","aggression on everybody's culture."]],[518,["That's how you have removed all the Indians","from say South America and North America."]],[522,["You see, everywhere, wherever these people","have gone they have finished the culture."]],[531,["It's a very, very special type of aggression these","people have and aggression has a reaction always."]],[539,["Either the other culture's people, those people who have other cultures, would strive to be this culture, because this is supposed to be the greatest of all."]],[548,["To say like that, that, \"We should not be afraid","of showing, we should not be ashamed of our body.\""]],[555,["What is something like privacy within us?"]],[558,["Is there nothing like privacy?","We should respect our bodies!"]],[568,["Now if this is the attitude taken, that everybody"]],[572,["\"Oh, this woman is inhibited because","she does not show off her body.\""]],[576,["The showing off of the body is nothing","but ... It is a subtle prostitution!"]],[585,["You see it's on and on and on."]],[588,["It's very subtle. Now another","suggestion comes in from there that,"]],[591,["for twenty five years they cannot believe that people can","remain celibate because in this country people cannot."]],[600,["but there are so many countries where they","really remain celibate till they are married;"]],[606,["so many of them."]],[610,["but according to them it is not possible, so those","who remain must be wrong. They are telling lies."]],[616,["And they force this on others","that, \"You come like us only!"]],[620,["Because our noses are cut,","so you also cut your noses.\""]],[629,["On all types of people"]],[630,["if you go anywhere, all the Western people,","what they have ruined is the culture,"]],[635,["it is the variety of culture. And such subtle","cultures they have reduced to nothing!"]],[641,["And by their aggression they have told people","that, \"We are (supposedly) the highest of highest."]],[649,["English language you must know! You","must know French! You must know this!\""]],[660,["Don't open this door."]],[663,["So, you see what I am saying is when","we understand, we have to change."]],[667,["We must know we have to be really humble."]],[669,["Not in language, not in behaviour but inside."]],[673,["To know that we do not","aggress others. Alright?"]],[676,["So this Labour has this one","problem, is only of aggression."]],[683,["One community here, you take example."]],[686,["Now, say you take an example, so called elite."]],[689,["That's why I liked Evita, they have","made a big satire on all the elites."]],[693,["The dancing how they do. They have made a satire on all the upper classes and all the lower classes and all that type."]],[701,["It's a very good one, I must say.","It's a very good satire. Evita!"]],[704,["It's a very good satire ever since long."]],[707,["So, now, if you have that aggression within","you existing, then better take it out."]],[718,["The culture of the Spirit has to","come in you. That has to be there."]],[723,["If that culture doesn't come, then","these all cultures are very aggressive,"]],[731,["and they can never give","any happiness to anyone."]],[736,["Labour people think that they are hurt by the","elites, or by the rich or the upper class."]],[743,["But what are they aspiring to be?"]],[745,["They're aspiring to be the rich people themselves!"]],[752,["They are hurt by the rich","and they want to be the rich."]],[754,["It would be like, if you were hurt by","somebody's shoes, you become the shoe itself."]],[761,["It you are hurt by the rich people,","then why do you want to be rich?"]],[763,["It's a simple question. For a person like me","who has no materialism, I cannot understand it."]],[770,["Shri Mataji can I say something","about our political system?"]],[777,["Yes."]],[778,["It was set up on the threes gunas,","you have radicals who are Rajas,"]],[782,["Conservatives who are Tamas and you have in the middle the Liberals who are Sattva, intelligence. And what you are saying is right...."]],[790,["But I tell you Liberals also need","Realisation! They are to be reborn."]],[794,["Otherwise you will have one horrible Jeremy","Thorpe. Why did you give him anywhere a seat?"]],[799,["You gave him a seat. Why should you give a seat? You","should have courage to say, \"Better not be there.\""]],[804,["He has got a seat!"]],[806,["He is going back for it."]],[808,["Ahh?"]],[810,["He's going back to his seat. He's","standing for his seat again."]],[813,["But what I'm saying......"]],[821,["No, no, but it's only after you see? But I tell you what."]],[825,["You see, unless and until they take","to realisation, it will not work."]],[831,["I told David Steel about Mataji,","I told David Steel about Mataji."]],[834,["You see, what I'm saying: just by proposing","that you are in the centre, you do not become."]],[840,["\"Sahaja, Sahaja,\" you see, Kabira has","said it: \"Sahaja, Sahaja, saba karata.\""]],[844,["\"They all say Sahaja, Sahaja, but they are not!\""]],[849,["You should be ashamed of such a","horrible leader you had for so many days."]],[853,["Jeremy Thorpe? Well he's","better than some we've had."]],[858,["No, no horrible he is! You just see","vibrations. Horrible person he is!"]],[864,["No!"]],[865,["No, no, no, all of them are just the same."]],[867,["To me all of them are just the same. There is","nothing to choose. But if you have a choice..."]],[872,["You see, England: we aren't an aggressive nation and I","don't like you saying that we are an aggressive nation!"]],[879,["No, no. You are not aggressive","when it comes to something else."]],[886,["But when it comes to cultures, you do like this."]],[889,["Well we are uneducated, I admit. When we came","to India we didn't know what we were doing,"]],[894,["so we cut off from it and we wouldn't","have anything to do with it."]],[897,["What English brought from India? Pyjamas! Jodhpurs! Verandahs!"]],[904,["The sun dial!"]],[905,["And what else did you buy? So, you","are aggressive that way. You see?"]],[909,["So all these things have to be changed."]],[911,["Like Indians must change and they should","not accept whatever you give them."]],[916,["Our aim of being in India was not an","aggressive one. And we weren't aggressive!"]],[923,["In India?"]],[923,["I don't like hearing these things!"]],[926,["You may not like it, but we have had it!! You see , you","don't know how they treated us. You have no idea Simon."]],[932,["When I go to India, why do they say, Victoria Rani?\""]],[938,["I want to know why in India they","say, \"Oh we want Rani back.\""]],[945,["Arey! If you pay money to someone!"]],[948,["Well I've met Indians who like Germans for kicking","us out, because without the second world war...."]],[952,["No, no, I'll tell you very simple.","Just Simon, Simon. Listen, listen."]],[957,["I shall tell you. You will understand if you listen Very simple.","It is very simple. It's a poor country."]],[963,["You gave them money, they can sell you anything. They have kitaabs and they gave these... we never had these..."]],[970,["Like they called somebody.. What do you","call that? All these M.A.D PhD's and all that,"]],[977,["Ahh.... Titles! They gave titles and","they gave this and that."]],[982,["You know, English know how to do it. And they","collected some people to say something about it."]],[990,["But the way they had to fight it out, you don't","know. You don't know. You were not there."]],[994,["Have you seen Satyajit Ray's","film 'The Chess Players?'"]],[997,["Have you seen Satya Ray's...? Satyajit","Ray is the best filmmaker in India."]],[1001,["That's what you people think, because","he tells all about our poverty!"]],[1006,["He doesn't know anything about","Indian culture, not a word."]],[1010,["He doesn't know anything about","spirituality; Satyaji Ray."]],[1013,["He's alright, people like him because","he sings the saga of communism."]],[1018,["That's why people like him. That's","not India! He never represents India."]],[1023,["It's alright, he is very good at getting very old people","from somewhere showing all their ribs and stomachs."]],[1032,["That's how he does and people like it, because there is a kind of sadism; we like to see the poverty. We like to see some people being tortured, because we feel we are tortured."]],[1043,["It's very subtle Simon, I tell you. You are","a different person. You cannot understand it."]],[1049,["But now you are different."]],[1052,["I'm not talking about the people who came to India,","but I am saying today also as the Western mind is."]],[1057,["You see with your rationality, with your so called scholarship, that you have"]],[1066,["the so called, we can say industrial..."]],[1070,["Indians these days go overboard for","Bertrand Russell... Lichtenstein.. and"]],[1076,["That's what I'm saying."]],[1077,["You see, this is what I'm saying! The same thing","as you are saying, I am saying the same thing."]],[1082,["You are giving them and they are taking","it, whether it is poison or anything."]],[1087,["This is what I am saying. They","are another kind of fool."]],[1091,["You are one type, they are another type."]],[1094,["You see, you aggress them and they take it."]],[1096,["If anything goes from","India, they will accept it."]],[1101,["If anything goes from England, they will","accept it! It's a funny thing going on."]],[1106,["But we get all these fake gurus, who've come from India."]],[1109,["Yes that is what I'm saying. You take","from them, they are another sect."]],[1114,["They are sending some gurus","for you. You accept them!"]],[1116,["And this is the mutual understanding going","on. There's a big fraternity of thugs."]],[1123,["After all, you built a fantastic","Wembley building for them."]],[1129,["See now! You see the joke. Whole thing! Once you say","that, \"We are the British.\" You are gone. Finished there!"]],[1134,["You just say, \"We are human beings,\"","and then you can see the whole joke."]],[1138,["If I say, \"I am an Indian,\" I'm gone, finished."]],[1142,["It's not a political thing."]],[1144,["See, it's not politically. It's much higher."]],[1146,["You see, you don't identify yourself with","any group and then you can see the joke."]],[1150,["If you identify, then you cannot."]],[1152,["You don't have to take it literally. You have to","take the essence of what Shri Mataji is saying."]],[1159,["If you listen, take the essence."]],[1160,["No, no, no! If you listen to me, the whole thing you will","understand it, very clearly, what I am trying to say."]],[1164,["Don't get angry! When I am saying","aggression is there. Aggression is the..."]],[1170,["You see, what I do not understand","that people do not study others"]],[1178,["and just bring about your own ideas","onto another, That's great aggression."]],[1186,["Now, in my own house, my two daughters are","there. I have not told them what is kundalini!"]],[1191,["Can you believe it?"]],[1195,["Can you believe it?"]],[1198,["Even not told them what is kundalini,","leave alone giving Realisation."]],[1204,["Same with my husband!"]],[1206,["If they do not want it, I am not going","to agress. This is non aggression."]],[1216,["But that doesn't mean I","accept aggression from them."]],[1221,["So when you accept aggression is the same","as to give aggression, if you do aggression"]],[1226,["For me both things are just the same."]],[1229,["So when we have to change ourselves,","we should say,\"What do we do?\""]],[1236,["\"Where are we?\" \"Are we aggressing","others or are we taking aggression?\""]],[1242,["Now, say Atul feels guilty, then","he's taking in aggression."]],[1247,["If you feel like egotistical way that, \"This is wrong.","That is wrong\" Then you are aggressing others."]],[1252,["All these things must be seen in it's full context and in","the full view of the whole thing, so you will understand."]],[1260,["But what happens? We identify","ourselves with one part of life."]],[1264,["We say, \"This is the thing.\" And either we","aggress others in that case or we take aggression."]],[1271,["This is sickness. This is the sign of sickness."]],[1274,["Anytime this happens, sickness starts."]],[1277,["And this is the cause of sickness of","all the human beings all over the world."]],[1286,["But once you identify yourself with the whole, then you start seeing the whole thing as a diseased thing."]],[1292,["And then you feel... treating","that disease as a doctor"]],[1296,["Then you do not identify","yourself with any sickness."]],[1301,["Alright? That is what means 'Sahaja' life is."]],[1307,["So now, if you have somebody sick..."]],[1309,["Alright, so now you understand,"]],[1313,["that by helping that particular person..."]],[1316,["Of course, it is your desire it will be","done, because you are one with the whole."]],[1321,["But the approach towards that sickness is different."]],[1326,["Do you understand my point?"]],[1328,["It's one way to help because he's","sick, he's poor, is different."]],[1333,["What I'm saying: the approach should be that","we become absolutely confident of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1339,["We establish our own powers. Absolutely!"]],[1342,["And then we make them the same,","because they will fall sick."]],[1346,["They'll have all problems, unless","and until they are alright."]],[1350,["So that is the primary thing that must be done."]],[1356,["Because,"]],[1358,["on one side they are the","people whose ego is hurt."]],[1363,["the other side are the people who","have been suffering from their egos."]],[1367,["If you have to help both of them,","you have to bring them in the centre."]],[1371,["Alright? Do you understand my point now?"]],[1373,["Now, to bring them in the centre","is not to sort of appease them"]],[1379,["Not that way. But by","developing the centre."]],[1382,["You see, let the centre grow first, on both the sides,","so it engulfs all that. Do you understand Maria?"]],[1391,["Yes, Mother."]],[1395,["They will never believe in God, because","that is the way they can assert their ego."]],[1403,["Indians are another set of fools, absolutely set of","fools, because the way they're following you people."]],[1409,["I mean you are already in the","ditch, where are they going?"]],[1414,["Firstly they do not have any values about","honesty about them. That's finished."]],[1420,["Now, even if they are getting the other values also from","you, then these sickly people, where will they be?"]],[1427,["As it is they are theives."]],[1428,["When a thief becomes an immoral","person, now what will happen to him?"]],[1434,["It's like somebody has","been bitten by a scorpion"]],[1439,["and on top of that he takes wine,","then what happens to such a person?"]],[1451,["So the aggression is within,","which is to be corrected."]],[1455,["For all Realised Souls, it is important to","see if we are taking any aggression within us"]],[1462,["is equally wrong as giving aggression."]],[1469,["You see, we have to develop a set of people who have idea of 'Reality,' those who understand what is 'Reality.'"]],[1485,["Those who are going to set in another type of","way, which will cut down this vicious circle."]],[1495,["We have to have that kind of mind, by which we see","the disease of the whole and try to correct it."]],[1510,["That's how we can manage."]],[1514,["but if you start identifying, even today I would","say, with any one of them, you are mistaken."]],[1519,["Now you understand my point?"]],[1521,["You just don't identify with any one of them!"]],[1525,["You have to identify yourself with 'Reality,' with","your 'Self.' To begin with! When you become that..."]],[1533,["Nirguna!"]],[1535,["Not necessarily nirguna!"]],[1537,["You start with saguna only. Because","I am in saguna, what to do?"]],[1542,["If you do not come in","saguna... saguna is 'with forms.'"]],[1546,["If you do not come in the form, nobody","understands, who will talk to you?"]],[1549,["A Nirguna cannot talk to you."]],[1558,["So the Saguna had to come.Alright!"]],[1561,["Now you establish within yourself the","complete understanding of the saguna."]],[1573,["Now don't doubt too much. If you are a doubting Thomas,","you will end up with zero! I can tell you this much."]],[1578,["We have had people for years together. There is one gentleman coming for seven years and you know him, and nothing could be done."]],[1584,["And he supposed to be a wrangler in mathematics!"]],[1590,["So, you must see the people who have understood","the saguna and how far they have gone."]],[1597,["And if you are to progress, you try","to understand it now, first of all."]],[1605,["Secondly, you must also understand,"]],[1608,["that you are going to be the people who are going","to lead the whole world into a new awareness,"]],[1616,["into a new life, into a new dimension!"]],[1623,["So don't identify with people who","are still blind, who do not see."]],[1631,["They'll make you more blind."]],[1635,["Identify yourself with people","who have seen something."]],[1644,["The ones who have had","experiences, you identify."]],[1647,["Put your attention to them,","then only you can see."]],[1655,["And that is only possible when you","start giving up your misidentifications."]],[1670,["As long as you have","misidentifications, you will be mad!"]],[1675,["You would not know what to do about it."]],[1677,["That's sickness!"]],[1681,["You got involved into these identifications gradually."]],[1685,["You see, because the atmosphere is like","that, the whole surrounding is like that."]],[1691,["From all sides you have","people who just engulfed you."]],[1695,["They club you into it!"]],[1696,["You have to jolly well come in","to it! Your freedom is cut off."]],[1700,["You are not free to think about it."]],[1708,["And that's how you are not","free from misidentifications."]],[1711,["To begin with you were alright, but gradually you started getting enveloped and identified with your mistakes."]],[1721,["How are you responsible for what your","forefathers have done in this country,"]],[1724,["or my forefathers have done in my country?"]],[1728,["Tell me. Who are they to you? They might have been born in China now with chinky eyes."]],[1739,["Or could be in Rye (?), or could be running","away with Amin as his soldiers. Could be anywhere!"]],[1747,["And we are not responsible for","them, whatever they have done."]],[1749,["Alright? Keep it at that point."]],[1752,["Now, if you feel responsible, say even","for anyone who belongs to your tribe,"]],[1762,["still it's wrong, because you are different people."]],[1768,["When you become that, then you must identify yourself with the new tribe, one who has known 'Reality.'"]],[1783,["But human beings identify very easily","with something so much illusory:"]],[1788,["like if you are born in England you are English,","if you are born in India, you are Indian."]],[1795,["You could have been born","in Singapore or any place!"]],[1801,["These all misidentifications create this problem in you."]],[1805,["Then with this identifications also,","you go into that... complete circles."]],[1811,["If you are an Indian, you start speaking","like an Indian: all the good and bad of it."]],[1817,["Same with English, same with","French, same with everything."]],[1822,["You see, gradually you start misidentification.","Missidentification starts working in you."]],[1829,["But you are the pure thing inside.","These all impurities cover you."]],[1835,["So to free yourself from all these impurities, of","any kind. I tell you this is like possession in you."]],[1846,["To be free absolutely of all","these things is the ultimate aim."]],[1857,["So, all these ideas, when they come into your head,"]],[1859,["please remember that all these have come to","us because we belong to a particular society,"]],[1868,["a particular caste or religion."]],[1871,["Now, for example, the other day, you know, there was a","gentleman who said, \"I feel very guilty all the time.\""]],[1877,["So I said, \"Are you a Catholic?\" He said, \"No.\""]],[1879,["So I said, \"You have no business to feel guilty!\""]],[1884,["Because if you are a Catholic, you","are made to feel guilty all the time."]],[1890,["It's a collective you see. Just from childhood if somebody gets a brain wash all the time, a little child doesn't understand."]],[1898,["You go on telling him, \"You are a sinner.\" He said, \"No?\""]],[1901,["You go on telling him, he'll say, \"Am I a sinner?\""]],[1903,["Then he goes to church. Then they tell, \"You are a sinner.\""]],[1908,["You must confess."]],[1911,["\"Repent, repent repent!\""]],[1914,["Repent, repent. Now he says,","\"What should I repent?\""]],[1917,["So he thinks about it, he goes to the priest","and he tells him that, \"I repent for one thing.\""]],[1924,["He said, \"What?\""]],[1926,["\"Because I opened the tap.\""]],[1928,["He said, \"What?\" \"I opened the tap and my","mother scolded me for that. I repent for that.\""]],[1934,["So, it starts from there, you see, and","the whole thing starts working out."]],[1940,["Then poor thing repents for something else."]],[1944,["But inside, when he's repenting, he's building up a pouch."]],[1951,["And that's how these horrible people, so called Christians or so called Hindus, all of them just the same."]],[1962,["But I am saying about these, how","they have gone against Christ."]],[1966,["There's one thing he taught is non-aggression."]],[1972,["You make somebody feel","guilty and you have it!"]],[1980,["Absolutely satanic!"]],[1982,["Is there any mention in the Bible, that","Christ wanted somebody to confess to him?"]],[1989,["Where did he mention by any chance."]],[1991,["No."]],[1992,["Then why these people have started this confession business? And who are they, compared to Christ, that they ask for confessions?"]],[2000,["Appointed by some theological college! Elected by some people where the smoke comes out of the chimney!"]],[2011,["All of these silly things you","digest without thinking about it."]],[2017,["and then you are misidentified also Maria. Alright?"]],[2022,["So you must understand. Be happy and joyous that","you have found the Eternal Life and be one with it."]],[2031,["I will Mother."]],[2032,["Alright. And you tell them off","that, \"You are all silly fools."]],[2035,["And you go ahead with your idiocity! And when","you are absolutely drowned, then come to us!\""]],[2041,["I used to do that until they strangled me. That's when","you found me Mother and you pulled me out of that."]],[2049,["That's what I used to say to spiritualist.","I used to tell them what I thought of them."]],[2056,["But why? You see , a spiritualist whom are they?"]],[2058,["Do you know who indulges?","All these poor things."]],[2062,["Same in India! They have all these horrible tantrikas, this, that."]],[2066,["As long as we involve it... I you see","there are countries like, you can say"]],[2071,["aah, say aah,"]],[2074,["tantrikas are mostly prevalent in Bengal, in Bihar,"]],[2078,["in UP., in Kerala, in Madras, Assam."]],[2087,["And there you find the poverty! And maximum","are in Bihar, which is the poorest of all!"]],[2101,["I mean the absurdity of these people: that","place that we went to, Kovalam, is in Kerala."]],[2109,["The people are extremely poor and","for the newspaper people, you see,"]],[2114,["this is the main issue they have; that poverty."]],[2117,["They want to sort of take advantage of their","poverty. As if they are very poor, live like poor."]],[2123,["And these people arranged my programme in a hall,","a big hall and it was a carpet or something,"]],[2128,["I don't know what it is."]],[2129,["So they published that she was living","in suites of rooms with.. what is it?"]],[2133,["Wall to wall"]],[2134,["wall to wall carpet and","this nonsense, you see!"]],[2138,["I was, poor thing, living with these people!"]],[2141,["But why? Because they wanted to imply that","she lives in luxury or whatever it is."]],[2147,["I live always in luxury whether I am poor","or rich. Makes no difference to me."]],[2151,["So, this is what is the accent they had. But","why there is poverty, why don't they think?"]],[2157,["Do you know, in that country,","such a wretched condition is,"]],[2161,["that Shri Shankaracharya","was born in that country,"]],[2166,["and these people told me that,","\"We do not know who he was"]],[2171,["and also we do not know that","he was born in this country.\""]],[2175,["They should be ashamed of themselves!"]],[2178,["And the second thing that they did"]],[2181,["that they tortured him"]],[2183,["because when he came back,","when his mother was sick,"]],[2186,["they would no even give him water."]],[2189,["They said, \"You are a sanyasi, you have no","business to come here, to your mother.\""]],[2192,["And they would not, when she","died, they would not burn her."]],[2197,["So, he burnt her in the house itself and he used all these... aah"]],[2210,["Banana. Banana tree to burn her off... to burn her off."]],[2217,["And then he cursed that country that, \"The way I have been...I have burned my mother, you will be doing the same.\""]],[2224,["So now they cannot burn. So what they do, they dig the graves and put them just in front of their houses."]],[2230,["So imagine every house is hovered over by all","the thousands of horrible people who are dead!"]],[2237,["We went to one village and asked the","condition of the people. They all ran out!"]],[2242,["They said, \"Oh God!\" Ask Rustom!"]],[2244,["They said, \"Mother, what sort of village is this?\""]],[2248,["And then you talk of emancipating","these horrible, nonsensical people!"]],[2256,["Why should God do that?"]],[2261,["They want to run after the tantrikas."]],[2268,["Then the bhoots come in and how can you","have your problem of poverty solved?"]],[2275,["Tell me any country where there are so many bhoots and there is riches."]],[2281,["Always you'll find the poor people","indulging into it than the rich!"]],[2286,["And once the rich start indulging","into it you'll also become."]],[2292,["It's a very simple thing."]],[2294,["I can understand if you people do not know,","but Indians know this, but still they do it."]],[2300,["that, if there is one bhoot coming inside your","house, all the Lakshmi will be destroyed."]],[2307,["Everyone knows this, but","still they do it in India."]],[2316,["There's no doubt Mother that the moment","you return to London the Left Agnya goes."]],[2321,["And when you leave it you can feel it releasing."]],[2326,["When I was in the plane I could feel..."]],[2327,["Ahh?"]],[2328,["When I was in the plane going to Germany I could feel","it release and when I was coming back it caught again."]],[2333,["England is full of it."]],[2337,["You see not use bringing up Labour","and Conservatives and all that."]],[2341,["If they want to listen to me, destroy all these","tantrikas from here, one and all. You'll be alright."]],[2347,["You try any trick.","You'll have problems."]],[2353,["But who will listen to me?"]],[2356,["They used to believe in witches","and all that once upon a time."]],[2361,["There used to be witch hunting and","all that, but they have stopped it."]],[2364,["Now witches are very nicely","settled down in this country."]],[2374,["Many Christians are witches Mother."]],[2376,["Yes! So-called Christians!"]],[2379,["No, it doesn't mean that they are bad."]],[2381,["They are not bad, but they are bad in a way,","because they bring all the bhoots from outside."]],[2388,["No, they make the fields grow and we have to","keep witches here otherwise we'd get no harvest."]],[2397,["Some bhoot is speaking through you. Some bhoot is speaking through you, you know"]],[2404,["I'm sorry, but I..."]],[2405,["Simon, you are correct, but you see,there is a witch in you that is speaking, you are not saying that."]],[2410,["You see how can you say witches should be here when I have just told you all about them, what they do."]],[2415,["Do you want people to suffer from poverty?"]],[2419,["Suffer from all kinds of mental diseases","and troubles? We don't want them here."]],[2432,["Do what you want. You do not know."]],[2435,["First you find out what you","want, write it down and meditate."]],[2438,["First of all you should get rid","of all these operations on you."]],[2442,["See in your room itself, there's a problem;"]],[2445,["these witches are here around. All of","them are here. You must clear them."]],[2451,["They all have to get out from this country."]],[2454,["If by my coming here, if I cannot do even that much,"]],[2457,["then what's the use of my coming here?"]],[2462,["But it you are identified with","them, then what can I do about it?"]],[2465,["All the churches are doing that."]],[2474,["As I have told you already that this","confession business is very wrong."]],[2481,["Whatever is the problem of a particular country is","to be handled in that particular country, isn't it?"]],[2488,["In India also we have the same problem."]],[2491,["But that's a very different type. I mean it is not regarded... You see, because it is not an organised religion, so I can wipe it out better, but it is organised here."]],[2499,["The Seven Day Adventist, these another horrible Pentecostals, they are organised, they are accepted by law. They are doing all these things here through law!"]],[2509,["Mother, don't you think when they give you a sense","of being guilty in Christianity and Catholic Church,"]],[2515,["they're wanting at the same","time to increase their power?"]],[2519,["Of course! It's a play! It's a play!"]],[2521,["But only an intelligent","man can see that's true."]],[2526,["You make somebody feel very guilty,","that is how they brainwash you!"]],[2530,["It's only brain washing. As","Hitler could brainwash Germans."]],[2536,["these people have also brainwashed you."]],[2539,["In India, also they do the","same thing - brainwashing!"]],[2543,["They have done all kinds of brainwashing,"]],[2545,["but the only difference is this, that","the Western religions are all organised."]],[2552,["So when they are organised they become firm"]],[2555,["and they have much more power than","a religion which is disorganised."]],[2561,["You can hit them better!"]],[2564,["Now the priest here is so much respected! In India a priest is not respected so much. Ask him, he is a Brahmin!"]],[2572,["You see if a priest comes into","your house we do not respect him."]],[2575,["You see, he takes money, we know he takes money. We do not respect him the way here the priest is respected."]],[2581,["Because it is organised. They have made their","norms and things by church, making some respect."]],[2589,["What is terrible they gave the religion: and during the Middle Age they give to the Western countries knowledge."]],[2597,["religion and knowledge."]],[2599,["They had incredible power."]],[2602,["That's it!"]],[2603,["Because through the knowledge they","wanted to introduce the religion."]],[2607,["And afterwards religion became to be knowledge."]],[2611,["So the vicious circle starts."]],[2614,["So you must decide it and you must give","up your misidentifications, first of all."]],[2618,["Because all your diseases come","from your identifications."]],[2622,["Alright? Say now you are Greek. Now Greeks also have","certain misidentifications, quite a lot of them."]],[2628,["Many!"]],[2630,["So once you start becoming a Sahaja","Yogi or a universal personality,"]],[2635,["you just dissipate. You do not pamper."]],[2639,["But if you are a real Greek,"]],[2641,["I never did."]],[2643,["I know that."]],[2643,["But if you are a real Greek, then you must tell all the other","Greeks also that, \"This is what it is!\" If you really love them."]],[2651,["I will be really please to say that to my aunts."]],[2658,["Your Aunt, I am not so much worried,","because that's an age now, they are gone."]],[2662,["But what about the future that's coming up."]],[2664,["Now the people who belong to such organised","religions, as they have, which has happened in India;"]],[2670,["(Unclear)"]],[2673,["in the same way it is going to happen here also, that they","are not going to believe in any religions whatsoever."]],[2679,["The other side has started as you","said! They don't believe in any God."]],[2688,["I don't know what they need to find out."]],[2690,["Ha?"]],[2690,["I don't really know what they need to find out."]],[2695,["Nothing! You see, it's just a swing from one extreme","to another extreme. It's just extreme, that's all."]],[2700,["There is no direction, there's no guidance."]],[2703,["It's just a swing from believing into too","much, fanaticism, to another is non- belief!"]],[2709,["Or Sahaja Yoga is not like that at","all. Extremes, you know, extremes!"]],[2716,["so from one extreme and to another","extreme, they go just automatically."]],[2720,["I mean it is absolutely inevitable."]],[2725,["You have to stop in the centre."]],[2728,["And those who are stopping must","grow, so they engulf all that."]],[2733,["This is what I'm trying to tell you. Alright?"]],[2737,["And then you'll start seeing them, then","you will know how horrible they are."]],[2744,["It's very painful Mother."]],[2745,["It's very painful to see how","horrible they are, it's true."]],[2750,["We have to, of course, cure them."]],[2752,["but first we should be alright, all of us","and we should pull all these things together."]],[2756,["I don't know Mother, I've noticed that one of the way","that the negativity works is that it attacks people"]],[2763,["and then it makes you feel sorry for them and then it sucks all your energy, so that you have no chance to do any work for Sahaja Yoga."]],[2770,["Like Rustom had this problem before,"]],[2773,["he was over sympathetic."]],[2775,["If you have sympathies…if you see the meaning","’sympathy’ – it means ‘sharing pathos’."]],[2780,["You share their pathos isn’t it!"]],[2784,["So this is also there. And now why, you see why I have","said this is that you have, in these Western countries,"]],[2790,["you have seen the aggression of your forefathers","so you are taking to the other courses."]],[2794,["You are over-sympathetic."]],[2797,["And that thing is going to","tell against you, absolutely."]],[2803,["There is nothing to sympathise."]],[2805,["There is to be so strong, that you","just solve the problems like that."]],[2810,["Sitting down here you should","be able to solve the problem."]],[2816,["So develop your powers."]],[2817,["Alright Simon? That’s what it is.","You must develop your powers."]],[2821,["And how will you develop them is by becoming","silent and silent within and seeing for yourself."]],[2829,["You have to just assume!"]],[2832,["You have powers already."]],[2834,["You have been enriched by all the Adi Shakti."]],[2837,["Everything has been done for you."]],[2840,["You’ve got it. You are already","empowered. Just use that."]],[2848,["Can you doubt that you are not empowered?"]],[2855,["You already have got powers and also","most of you know what is to be done."]],[2865,["You know what is this power to be used for."]],[2869,["You have the knowledge as well."]],[2874,["But only thing is to assume it! You have to assume."]],[2878,["We need the wisdom as well."]],[2880,["You have! You don’t need Maria."]],[2884,["You have a lot of it. Only thing","is don’t sympathise with them."]],[2888,["Just don’t worry about them.","They are foolish people."]],[2894,["This is what I have been doing all the time."]],[2896,["That’s not proper. You don’t waste your energy on","that, that’s why you have thinned down so much."]],[2906,["There’s a saying in Urdu, “Kazidli","bidli ka shayed kya deshakte”"]],[2910,["they say, “Priest, why are you so sick?","Because you are worried about the whole world”!"]],[2914,["(Break in recording.)"]],[2916,["Pay attention."]],[2917,[" But your attention should be detached in that case. "]],[2920,["If it is not a detached attention you cannot do that."]],[2937,["It’s only one second you need.","You just say, “Go away all of you!"]],[2943,["Go away!"]],[2949,["So, you see for... we had an example","of that in Bombay, in Delhi."]],[2955,["We had those Ramkrishna","mission people. Just tell them!"]],[2960,["There was a lady who had cancer from the same","ashram and she said, “Why? I was doing upkar"]],[2966,["I was helping others. I was looking after them.”"]],[2970,["I said, “Then why did you get cancer?”"]],[2973,["She said, “Now in my upkar  I’ve got it.”"]],[2976,["So I said, “You enjoy it now!”"]],[2980,["You have paid for it by doing upkar!"]],[2983,["Upkar is ... Upkar means in Hindi",".. doing it with our doing it"]],[2994,["You just do it, without doing it. You even do not know you are doing. It's so simple. Alright?"]],[3001,["It becomes part of your inner religion."]],[3003,["Yes, otherwise, you think you are doing something, that means pride comes into you, and the whole thing is spoiled."]],[3010,["But Mother, the more we surrender and the more","we have faith, the more it will be alright."]],[3016,["Yes, it will be alright.You see, if you are alright, if","you are strong people, then the Virata becomes alright,"]],[3022,["the Primordial becomes alright, if you become a strong body."]],[3029,["If some part of the body is sick you can cure it."]],[3033,["How many cells do you need to fight them? Not much."]],[3046,["But we are the fighting","cells. We have to fight them."]],[3049,["By not becoming identified with them."]],[3052,["You see, you have to fight with them in","such a way that you do not weep for them."]],[3057,["Means you are affected by them. No!"]],[3060,["You are detached."]],[3062,["You just say, “You will be","alright,” and they will be alright."]],[3065,["So much powers you","have! Do you know that?"]],[3069,["But once you start weeping for","them, the power is neutralised."]],[3077,["It should be done without any guide, anything,","you just say, “Alright, you will be alright.”"]],[3081,["Which is all well and good. Otherwise","there is no question of prestige for us!"]],[3087,["If somebody is cured, well and good. We have","not taken everybody’s bond that we should do it."]],[3103,["We’ll do if we want to. If we don’t want to we’ll","not do it. It’s in complete freedom that we do it."]],[3109,["At least I do! It’s in absolute freedom,"]],[3115,["because if I want to do, I will","do; otherwise I will not do."]],[3119,["In the same way you should be."]],[3123,["So then the detachment comes you see. Complete freedom","is also complete detachment, and that is complete love."]],[3133,["Sometimes Mother when I go to some place people say that they used to know me before feeling very much for them and showing it,"]],[3143,["and that, if through Sahaja Yoga you become","unfeeling…That’s how they interpret it, becoming unfeeling."]],[3150,["Unfeeling? No you should say, “Now","I understand that what was lacking."]],[3157,["And I have too much feeling for","you. You become Sahaja Yogis.”"]],[3160,["You see, they always depended on","you and you had to give them."]],[3165,["Alright, now you should say,","“You also become givers now!"]],[3169,["Through Sahaja Yoga you","can become equal to me."]],[3172,["I want you to become that.”"]],[3174,["You see, sitting down and weeping for somebody","is no good. And some people are like this also."]],[3181,["They like the sympathy?"]],[3183,["You see, they like the show of the thing."]],[3189,["Say you go to a place and they say,","“Oh, have you seen? Is he with her?”"]],[3194,["All that should go away."]],[3197,["Maria, for a person like me, I will just,","I may not even bother. Why should I?"]],[3204,["I’m not attached. But then, you see, people like it if","somebody comes and too much asks. That's not feeling!"]],[3212,["Feeling is when it is in pure detachment."]],[3219,["You are not feelingless, you are not","emotionless, but you are emotion."]],[3225,["You become the emotion."]],[3233,["Emotion is identified with you completely."]],[3237,["Do you understand?"]],[3238,["Yes"]],[3238,["You are the emotion."]],[3241,["The complete ocean: ocean of emotion."]],[3243,["You generate emotion!"]],[3245,["When you are with people they get into emotions."]],[3249,["You can inspire emotions into them."]],[3253,["But nobody’s emotion should affect","you, then only it is possible."]],[3261,["Even the ocean cannot become like a pond."]],[3265,["Do you remember Mother, in the letter, I wrote a","sentence that I have a little bit of a problem of work."]],[3273,["This was the problem Mother."]],[3275,["Although I put the people's names in a","bandhan and I would pray for them at home,"]],[3281,["at work I would be detached from their emotions and their problems"]],[3286,["and because of that they would be upset","why they could not attract my attention."]],[3296,["You see, my attention was attracted but","not to the point to become part of it"]],[3301,["and that would upset them and that’s why I had the","problem because they sent very negative vibrations back"]],[3308,["which eventually I could not tolerate and feel.."]],[3314,["No, you should be tactful about it."]],[3316,["You should be tactful. You should be tactful about them."]],[3320,["That is not the thing. Only thing is, you see, even if you","bleed, it doesn’t matter as long as it doesn’t hurt you inside."]],[3327,["If it’s all outside, it’s alright."]],[3330,["Attention, when you give to somebody,","you should be fully attentive to yourself."]],[3336,["But the attention Mother, that they needed","was a selfish one which I did not entertain."]],[3344,["Don’t entertain them. You see,","what I am saying is that,"]],[3346,["as you are Realised you will be surprised that you are in","a different wavelength absolutely, on a different position."]],[3353,["And it is going to be a little difficult to adjust","with others because they want you the same person."]],[3359,["You cannot be the same. You are a different one."]],[3361,["It was only that you could give them","something for the time being, that’s all."]],[3367,["But now, they will know that you have curative","powers; you can cure them, you can do things."]],[3371,["Your value will go up much more!"]],[3376,["So you need not try to worry about these things. Gradually they will accept you."]],[3380,["Things have sorted themselves out."]],[3382,["Yes, they will sort it out! There are thousands of people behind you! You don’t know there are chiranjeevas (eternal beings) there are great personalities behind you."]],[3391,["So you just let go."]],[3393,["And we are not to be guided by their norms, not by them. We have to put our own norms because we are different people."]],[3404,["But first have confidence in yourselves! First thing!"]],[3417,["Are you better Atul now?"]],[3421,["Now, Simon how are you? Are you","feeling guilty about something?"]],[3424,["No."]],[3428,["Now you don’t swing from one end to","another, just try to keep in the centre."]],[3438,["You have read a lot and you know a lot,"]],[3444,["that’s called as dhyana. You have got dhyana."]],[3447,["But you haven’t got bodha."]],[3451,["Bodha."]],[3452,["Oh Bodhi?"]],[3453,["Bodha"]],[3455,["Means your dhyana is not","enlightened as yet. Aright?"]],[3460,["Because one is ‘to know’, and the another is","‘to know that the knowledge is enlightened’."]],[3467,["This is the difference","between the two. Alright?"]],[3471,["The other day Gavin asked me, “What is samadhi?”","So I told him, \"It is enlightened awareness.\""]],[3478,["Enlightened awareness. You are aware, but","you are not enlightened. Samadhi is that."]],[3484,["So in Sahaja Yoga, first you get nirvichara samadhi","– that is thoughtless enlightened awareness."]],[3493,["And secondly you get nirvikalpa samadhi –","that is doubtless enlightened awareness."]],[3504,["So to go to doubtless condition","you must know to avoid doubts."]],[3510,["You have to change your style of approach."]],[3513,["You see, other things you might","have achieved through doubting,"]],[3519,["but Sahaja Yoga is achieved through resolve."]],[3527,["You even have to pretend that","you don’t doubt to start with."]],[3529,["You have to go on pretending with yourself. Tell your mind, “I","am not going to doubt.” Go on for a while. Then it works out."]],[3536,["There’s nothing like the faith."]],[3539,["Faith, I am saying, not","the blind faith but faith."]],[3543,["You have got the vibrations","now. Now believe into them!"]],[3551,["That’s the only way!"]],[3555,["There’s no other way out I can tell you this much.","Those who have taken to doubting will never approach it."]],[3565,["You’ll be thrown away all the time with doubts."]],[3570,["And a time may come when my attention may","recede and you’ll drop out just like that."]],[3575,["You just cannot do Sahaja Yoga like","that. But blind faith is not needed."]],[3581,["First you feel the vibrations."]],[3583,["You see for yourself."]],[3586,["Either we absolutely have blind faith or we have","rationality. Can’t we be something in between?"]],[3595,["The people who are absolutely blind are useless."]],[3600,["They might be saved because if they can ask questions to me that, “Are you this? Are you that?” Then they can be saved."]],[3606,["If they come to that point!"]],[3609,["But those who are rational, they can never come into it!"]],[3615,["Because it’s like jumping like a monkey, from one","branch to another branch. You can never land down."]],[3624,["It’s only through faith, shraddha, through","surrendering, you are going to achieve that state."]],[3639,["And then small ripples here and there,","nothing, is going to disturb you."]],[3647,["You are going to enjoy that state within","yourself. Allow your faith to dissolve you."]],[3662,["You know the time is very short."]],[3666,["You’ve got your Realisation and you take so","much time after that to come up to that,"]],[3676,["and that time is very much lost. Why do it?"]],[3680,["Now you have seen people who have shraddha how","far they have gone, so why not follow them?"]],[3699,["So that is very important"]],[3702,["that, by doubting you are not","going to achieve anything!"]],[3709,["You’ll be tossing. But you are to really put…"]],[3714,["Big girls have gone out."]],[3719,["The big girls have gone out to play, you","also go out and play with them, alright?"]],[3723,["OK."]],[3724,["Alright. See, how confident!","Because they are innocent."]],[3730,["They have faith in themselves."]],[3736,["So stop your rationality. It is not going to take you anywhere!"]],[3749,["You have to learn to develop your shraddha. Even you get Realisation, you cure people, you do anything."]],[3757,["We have an example of somebody you know of."]],[3760,["His mother was cured just like that. He was cured just like","that. He got a job just like that. He got whatever he wanted,"]],[3768,["and then suddenly he drops out!"]],[3770,["Without any shraddha."]],[3779,["So that is what it is."]],[3786,["So many have done like that because if you do not have shraddha, you get tired of jumping from one to another."]],[3796,["All the time you are doubting in","this. It’s just a mental feat."]],[3800,["We like to do circus for a while, it’s alright, but forget it! Now jump into it and get it!"]],[3807,["Now what do you lose?"]],[3811,["You lose nothing!"]],[3814,["We lose ego."]],[3817,["Ego. You lose your ego but you get your personality."]],[3821,["What do you lose? Nothing.","You get all the powers."]],[3826,["Now the time is too short and you","are taking too long to do it."]],[3832,["And some of you will be tired, jumping like that all the time","with your doubts, this way, that way. And what are you doubting?"]],[3842,["It’s all free."]],[3844,["You don’t have to do anything about it."]],[3849,["And doubting people can be quite foolish."]],[3852,["They doubt about every nonsensical","thing which has no meaning at all."]],[3857,["They see things which do not exist"]],[3861,["because it’s just, you see, a habit, or you can say an indulgence; you can say an entertainment for people, to doubt into this. And then doubt."]],[3870,["You see they are just jumping like monkeys."]],[3874,["Stop that!"]],[3882,["Any one of you who goes down into shraddha and dissolves becomes a great instrument in the hands of God!"]],[3899,["Even to say that, “I doubt,” is wrong."]],[3903,["These people think we are very honest","by saying, “I doubt. I doubt Mother.”"]],[3909,["Please give up such ‘honesties’!"]],[3912,["It’s absurd!"]],[3915,["This is ego which is making you","say these things that, “I doubt.”"]],[3921,["Because by saying that, it exists and you feel you are very honest. It’s not you are doubting, your ego is doubting."]],[3932,["When you realise that, that your ego","is doubting, it will become easier."]],[3939,["“It’s not I who is doubting,","it’s my ego which is doubting."]],[3944,["Or maybe some possession","in me which is doubting.”"]],[3950,["“Am I playing into the hands of","some possession or my own ego?”"]],[3957,["That’s what it is – hundred percent!"]],[3962,["Because those who have not doubted have gone","too far. You have seen people in India."]],[3968,["You have seen Dhumal."]],[3971,["He never doubted!"]],[3974,["His own brother, he was helped so much: he had no money to eat his food,"]],[3979,[" he had gone to that condition because he had put a lot of money in a business which was failing."]],[3983,["When he came to Sahaja Yoga his business","started earning just like that."]],[3987,["He became a moneyed man."]],[3989,["His child was sick, he was cured. He was sick, he was cured."]],[3992,[" His wife was sick with something incurable, she was cured."]],[3996,["But still he was doubting."]],[4000,["He started taking drinks after that."]],[4002,["He never used to take drinks, after","doubting he started taking drinks."]],[4005,["He did all that was prohibited in Sahaja Yoga just to prove his point."]],[4010,["And where is he now?"]],[4017,["I would say, pay attention to","your Self and not to your doubts!"]],[4023,["The doubts are coming from some dark","corners of your mind which is with you."]],[4029,["What are you going to lose is","the point you must look into."]],[4034,["Sort it out there. What have others lost?"]],[4039,["They have gained."]],[4043,["Those who have doubted have lost, lost time."]],[4057,["So don’t waste your time in useless things."]],[4064,["There’s nothing to doubt."]],[4071,["Every word I say is","the truth and the truth."]],[4079,["See the vibrations."]],[4086,["You see! I have to boast."]],[4090,["You see! Every word."]],[4098,["So don’t doubt it!"]],[4100,["Just take it and take it and take it."]],[4105,["I know all this myself."]],[4108,["I am not going to achieve anything by telling you these things,"]],[4115,["except that you will know me and I will know you."]],[4129,["You are not to lose anything. You have to gain."]],[4135,["So tell your mind to shut up for a while! It","is already running with a very fast speed."]],[4158,["We want to get to that state of complete","doubtless awareness and, for that,"]],[4164,["are we going to carry these","doubts in our pockets?"]],[4171,["They have no meaning. They will all be neutralised. You have seen people who have neutralised it. But those who do it…"]],[4184,["I have no word."]],[4195,["Steady your shraddha. Steady it!"]],[4198,["It’s a force. It’s like a flame of a candle."]],[4203,["Steady it!"]],[4205,["But by your doubts you are putting heavy pressure","on it and the flame, it has to face those doubts."]],[4218,["You are weakening yourself!"]],[4237,["Simon you have to get well. You are a seeker for ages now."]],[4241,["In many lives you have been seeking. And now you","are not going to play about anymore. Alright?"]],[4247,["You are going to be a certain","(unclear) . Absolutely, alright?"]],[4253,["Mataji may I go now?"]],[4256,["Alright. You may go."]],[4258,["See you"]],[4260,["And you throw those away and bring","seven more [lemons] to me in my house."]],[4264,["Tomorrow night?"]],[4265,["Tomorrow night."]],[4267,["What time would you like me to turn up?"]],[4269,["Oh, any time from about five","onwards, that’s better. Alright?"]],[4273,["Five, six, anytime. Come to my house, bring them. "]],[4278,["And ask Philippa to come and see me also tomorrow evening, if possible,"]],[4282,["because I’ll talk to her about","this, what is to be given."]],[4286,["Seven chillies as well as seven lemons?"]],[4288,["Yes, yes. Alright? And as I love you, try to","love yourself. And now don’t get after yourself."]],[4381,["One more thing I would like to tell you, because","there's time today, I can tell you about these things."]],[4388,["for certain chakras how to clear","them, even physically you can try."]],[4394,["One of them is of Vishuddhi chakra."]],[4397,["Now for Vishuddhi chakra, I have told you many things but you can try one more thing which will help you."]],[4404,["Is to put your head on the ground like this,"]],[4408,["near a bed, with your feet on the bed, resting on the bed."]],[4413,["And try to come on the bed more and more,"]],[4420,["more and more."]],[4422,["The body... push it on the bed so the whole pressure comes up here."]],[4427,["Alright. And then keep my photograph handy."]],[4431,["In that stage you see my photograph.","It will improve your Vishuddhis."]],[4438,["In that case, in case you have Left Vishuddhi,"]],[4442,["then you turn your face towards the right and see it."]],[4448,["If you have the Right Vishuddhi then turn","your face to the left and see my photograph."]],[4453,["That will help you because all of you have","Vishuddhi problem. This will be of help."]],[4459,["You mean the neck on the floor?"]],[4462,["On the floor if you lie down."]],[4465,["Now just lie down now, facing that side","towards the…yes, now go ahead, like that."]],[4474,["Gavin be careful. Now, go down. You go down, and more, more."]],[4480,["Again try to bring this lower portion on top."]],[4484,["Bring the body straight."]],[4489,["Yes. So that there isn’t much of a Hatha Yoga."]],[4492,["Can you see? Yes."]],[4496,["Do you rest the weight on your shoulders","or the head? Pressure on the neck?"]],[4504,["More on the Vishuddhi. Better now?"]],[4511,["Where do you have the photo if you’re not going to look at it?"]],[4522,["No, no. You have the photo whichever side you look."]],[4525,["Yeah, I know. But if you’re not going","to look to the left or the right?"]],[4529,["You turn your photograph with you. You must look at the","photograph isn’t it? Because it helps your Agnya, always."]],[4534,["You see, if your Agnya is kept clear then","it should be cleared out better, that's why."]],[4540,["You see that's why you have to have a photograph,"]],[4542,["because your Agnya can be cleared out with that. Otherwise the Agnya is blocked. You see? Better?"]],[4548,["Hmmm. It’s very good."]],[4550,["Very good!"]],[4553,["All of you should try this thing."]],[4555,["I have told you about, for Swadishthana,","what should be done. That you remember?"]],[4560,["Should I show them?"]],[4561,["Yes show them what is to be done","for Swadishthana – physically."]],[4570,["And you say the mantra?"]],[4574,["Yes you can say the mantra,","would be a good idea."]],[4579,["Now for people who have a problem of Mooladhara,"]],[4582,["or say those who cannot sit on the ground and sort of thing:","for them, it’s to practice with both your legs like this."]],[4592,["Put them like that, you too have the same problem."]],[4597,["Put these two [feet] together like this. You see, you cannot stretch it much. Try to stretch it down (the knees) on to the ground!"]],[4605,["Try to, try to, as much as you can!","But, in one shot you cannot do it!"]],[4613,["You have to put your knees down?"]],[4614,["Yes. Put your knees down.","They must touch the ground."]],[4619,["I can do perfectly, despite my fat!"]],[4627,["Try to raise it and push that down. Gradually you have to do it. You’ll do it the bathroom, you will work it out."]],[4634,["That’s very good. You lift this so","only your Mooladhara is touching."]],[4646,["Try to put it further, further. Now try to do that -","further. That helps you see, that helps. Further up! No."]],[4653,["No, no, put this together and move that! Just push that,","just feet. No, no feet! Spread the feet ."]],[4661,["Feet apart."]],[4663,["Now do as I tell you."]],[4666,["Where do you live?"]],[4668,["Wiltshire."]],[4670,["Spread much more. Spread it much more"]],[4676,["That helps you see. That helps."]],[4680,["First you do this exercise."]],[4694,["It’s working out. It’s much better now."]],[4706,["Gradually, you will see it will work","out, gradually. It's better now."]],[4709,["You see gradually it will work out, gradually, if you do it."]],[4712,["It’s good for Mooladhara. For all the people who","have mooladhara problem, this would be a good idea."]],[4718,["So gradually we should see to different chakras."]],[4723,["Now for the Hamsa."]],[4725,["Which Chakra?"]],[4726,["Hamsa!"]],[4728,["You lie on your body like that on your stomach."]],[4738,["Now come along!"]],[4740,["Put your these things, Mooladharas, here on the Hamsa,"]],[4746,["and now ask the Mother Earth to suck in your problems."]],[4752,["But the pressure should be quite a lot on that."]],[4768,["Now you move it."]],[4782,["Better? You feel better? You can feel the","sensation at the bottom. Allow them to disappear."]],[4792,["Here, even your pressure will go away from your…"]],[4797,["You’ll feel relieved from the pressure."]]]);
